   "text": "One episode, on one clock. Four head views and two wrist views. Depth and point cloud from the stereo pair. Six-degree-of-freedom head and wrist pose; twenty joint angles per hand. Gaze, EMG and EEG at their native rates. In the controlled L3 setting these quantities are measured, not inferred, a reference the shallower tiers can be scored against.",
