   "text": "The corpus is not one kind of room. Thirty-eight scene classes across five zones: residential, commercial, professional, industrial, public, plus residual. Ninety-nine task verbs. Six hundred and thirty-five object classes. A long tail, deliberately kept. The deeper the tier, the more controlled the staging: L3 is roughly seventy percent bench-controlled.",
